---
config:
  theme: base
  sequence:
    wrapPadding: 0
    boxTextMargin: 10
    boxMargin: 10
  themeVariables:
    primaryColor: darkgreen
    primaryTextColor: white
    primaryBorderColor: gray
---
sequenceDiagram
    box rgba(0,50,0,1) Nais
        actor User
        participant NadaCLI as Nada CLI
    end
    box rgba(50,0,0,1) Nais
        participant Postgres
        participant NaisDNS as DNS
    end
    box rgba(0,0,50,1) Dataplattform
        participant Ingesterator
        participant DebeziumOperator as Debezium Operator
        participant Panda as Kubernetes
        participant Debezium
        participant Kafka
    end

    User ->> NadaCLI: Run "nada ingest enable"
    NadaCLI ->> Postgres: Configure server parameters
    NadaCLI ->> Postgres: Add replication user role
    NadaCLI ->> Postgres: Add schema and heartbeat table
    NadaCLI ->> Ingesterator: Request replication setup
    Note over Postgres, NaisDNS: Postgres instance qualifier<br/>and replication user credentials
    Ingesterator ->> Panda: Generate Secret
    Panda -->> Ingesterator: Success
    Ingesterator ->> Panda: Generate Ingest
    Panda -->> Ingesterator: Success
    Ingesterator -->> NadaCLI: Success
    NadaCLI -->> User: Success

    loop Kubernetes operators
        Panda -->> Ingesterator: Updates to Ingest resource
        Ingesterator ->> NaisDNS: Lookup Postgres pod IPs
        NaisDNS -->> Ingesterator: Return DNS record
        Ingesterator ->> Panda: Generate DebeziumServer
        Panda -->> DebeziumOperator: Refresh
        DebeziumOperator ->> Panda: Create Debezium deployment
        Panda ->> Debezium: Provision and start
    end

    loop Continuous Data Capture
        Debezium -->> Postgres: Direct TCP connection
        Postgres -->> Debezium: WAL replication data stream
        Debezium -->> Kafka: Encode and produce messages
    end
